SYNTHESIS
  1. The LRC movie naturally walks on tournament isomorphism classes.
  2. The safe bit is often not a function of the unmarked A000568 class.
  3. Even pointed classes can mix safe and unsafe cells; gap lengths and
     endpoint labels are extra sheaf data over the A000568 base.
  4. Therefore the most plausible analogy is convoluted but sharp:
     LRC is a forbidden-cover / section-existence problem over the
     A000568 isoclass quotient, with projection defect as the obstruction.
